ch cho x\'e3 h\u7897\'3fi.
\par a) V\u7873\'3f ph\'e1p lu\u7853\'3ft.
\par - Gi\'e1o d\u7909\'3fc cho ph\u7841\'3fm nh\'e2n hi\u7875\'3fu r\'f5 nh\u7919\'3fng quy\u7873\'3fn v\'e0 ngh\u297\'69a v\u7909\'3f}{\f50\insrsid8545579\charrsid8545579  c\'f5 b}{\f0\insrsid8545579\charrsid8545579 \u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3f}{
