\f0\insrsid8545579\charrsid8545579 \u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh vi ph\u7841\'3fm t\u7897\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa h\u7885\'3f}{\f42\insrsid8545579\charrsid8545579 : C\'e1c quy \'f0}{\f0\insrsid8545579\charrsid8545579 \u7883\'3fnh v\u7873\'3f gi\u7843\'3fm \'e1n, ho\'e3
n ch\u7845\'3fp h\'e0nh \'e1n ph\u7841\'3ft t\'f9, t\u7841\'3f}{\f42\insrsid8545579\charrsid8545579 m \'f0}{\f0\insrsid8545579\charrsid8545579 \'ecnh ch\u7881\'3f thi h\'e0nh \'e1n ph\u7841\'3ft t\'f9, gi\u7843\'3fm th\u7901\'3fi h\u7841\'3fn ch\u7845\'3f
p h\'e0nh \'e1n ph\u7841\'3ft t\'f9; t\u7921\'3f th\'fa; xo\'e1 \'e1n v.v...
\par - Ph\'e1p l\u7879\'3fnh thi h\'e0nh \'e1n ph\u7841\'3ft t\'f9. Quy ch\u7871\'3f v\'e0 n\u7897\'3fi quy tr\u7841\'3fi giam.
\par b) Gi\'e1m th\u7883\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc cho ph\u7841\'3fm nh\'e2n h\u7885\'3fc nh\u7919\'3fng v\u7845\'3f}{\f42\insrsid8545579\charrsid8545579 n \'f0}{\f0\insrsid8545579\charrsid8545579 \u7873\'3f}{\f50\insrsid8545579\charrsid8545579  c\'f5 b}{
